title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/viewer:speed
catalog: GUI command
target: viewer:speed
summary: File: step the playback rate

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``viewer`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``ctrl+down`` → ``viewer:speed down`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
* ``ctrl+up`` → ``viewer:speed up`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
* ``shift+backspace`` → ``viewer:speed reset`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
